      "text": "A screenshot of the mHealth Working Group online discussion platform, showing a navigation bar (Home, Discussions, Library, Calendar), a filter set to 'Last modified', and a list of discussion thread previews with poster names, dates and brief excerpts, including topics on solar chargers for tablets, CommCare webinars, and a USAID/ASH mHealth Compendium release.",
